<section class="section"><div class="wrap faq-grid"><div><span class="eyebrow">A little more clarity</span><h2>Good questions.<br>Straight answers.</h2><p>Still have something on your mind?<br><a class="text-link" href="/pages/contact">Send us a message ↗</a></p></div><div class="faq-list"><details><summary>Who is JobPlug for?</summary><p>JobPlug supports recent graduates and professionals seeking a better role and people changing careers. The business works across industries.</p></details><details><summary>Which plan should I choose?</summary><p>Secure is ${{ settings.price_secure }} paid in full. Secure Plus is ${{ settings.price_secure_plus }} in two payments. Both run 30 business days.</p></details><details><summary>How does Interview Prep work?</summary><p>Interview Prep is ${{ settings.price_interview_prep }} per 45 minute live session. Buy Now. Then press Book Your Session after checkout to pick your time.</p></details><details><summary>What happens after I buy?</summary><p>Press Start Your Setup after checkout. It opens the official intake form. Tell us your goals and we take it from there. Questions? Email jobplugx@gmail.com.</p></details><details><summary>Where does my intake information go?</summary><p>The intake form is JobPlug’s official Google Form. When you submit Google Forms saves the response directly to that form.</p></details></div></div></section>
